tation.\",\"Read all assigned current root documentation and feature-evidence text. The capability inventory was read in complete compact chunks, including all 178 method records, 50 groups and 15 additional workflows. Historical test/result claims and hashes in these current files were treated only as documentation data, never as independently established findings or present test results; historical references were not followed.\",\"Ran only an isolated static-data parser written under .work. Its conservative complete-consuming YAML subset parser rejects unsupported syntax and duplicate keys, validates all 337 package integrity fields, all package/snapshot field kinds, all 22 importer roots against package.json, all 623 dependency edges, reachability of all 337 snapshots and package/snapshot correspondence. It parses all 1545 go.sum records with canonical h1 checksums, rejects duplicate module/version keys and verifies archive plus go.mod checksums for every one of the 193 current go.mod requires. It also strict-parses all 22 assigned JSON files and cross-checks capability counts/group links.\",\"No implementation, test or contract source was edited. Only new ignored audit-helper/evidence/report files under .work were written. No previous audit reports, WORKLOG, historical summaries or old implementation/Git historical code were read. No full or targeted suite, application operation, dependency install, build or minimal defect probe was performed.\"]",
